	<string>Blood Markers can attach photos from your library to log meals and lab reports in the chat.</string>
	<key>NSPhotoLibraryAddUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Blood Markers saves meal photos so they can be logged and reviewed later.</string>
	<key>NSMicrophoneUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Blood Markers uses the microphone so you can log meals by speaking.</string>
